# Add patterns of files dvc should ignore, which could improve
# the performance. Learn more at
# https://dvc.org/doc/user-guide/dvcignore

# Python bytecode caches, so transient __pycache__/*.pyc never pollute the md5 of
# a directory DVC hashes -- including workflow/ when a downstream repo tracks it as
# a stage dependency, and the test/data fixtures. They are never part of the logic.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
